The separately built libunixnu-ldid.dylib signer library uses Procursus ldid
under AGPL-3.0-or-later, OpenSSL 3.5.5 under Apache-2.0, and libplist 2.7.0
under LGPL-2.1-or-later. Its wrapper, ldid-library.cpp, includes the ldid
source and is AGPL-3.0-or-later. Their full license files accompany the runtime
under /usr/libexec/appsync-licenses. Exact corresponding source archives and
hashes are recorded in signer-sources.json; the ldid change is
ldid-adhoc.patch. The signer cache retains ldid-library.o, libcrypto.a and
libplist.a for relinking.
